     99  1a6a							; M or SPACE changed: muteNow = mute xor momentary. The SID goes to volume 0;
    100  1a6a							; the Game Boy and NES get note-offs (so nothing hangs on, and their tails
    101  1a6a							; ring out naturally), and their notes come back when it unmutes.
    102  1a6a				   MuteChanged
    103  1a6a					      subroutine
